LICENCE NOT YET DECIDED
=======================

Ikigai DB's licence is an open decision (REQUIREMENTS.md, OQ-1). The working assumption is a
permissive licence (Apache-2.0 or MIT), but this has NOT been settled.

Until this file is replaced with a real licence text:

  - This code is not published under any open-source licence.
  - All rights are reserved by the copyright holder.

Resolving this is task T4.36 and is a blocker for v1.0 GA.

See CLEANROOM.md for why this decision must not be foreclosed by accident.
